Test helper: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceBase.java`, lines 170-179 — `fillCity(String city, int n)` creates `n` unique owners all in the same city to drive the per-city capacity/warning rules. `createOwnerOk` (160-162) and `getOwner` (189-191) are also used by the test.

## OwnerRepository methods for counting owners by city

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java` — there is **no** dedicated count-by-city method. Available methods:
- `Collection<Owner> findByLastName(String lastName)` (line 46)
- `Page<Owner> findByLastName(String lastName, Pageable)` (line 48)
