- `void delete(Owner owner)` (line 84)

Both existing per-city rules (`RequireCityCapacity`) and per-date rules (`AssignBulkSignupWarning`) count by calling `findAll()` and filtering/streaming in Java — there is no `countByCity`-style repository method. Any new capacity-warning logic would follow the same `findAll().stream().filter(...).count()` approach.

